ible.\r\n\r\nThere is one issue here though, reference is not derived from `Node`, I was thinking of this PR primarily to speed up `SceneTree` traversal.\r\n\r\nIf we want to extend it to all `Objects`, we either decide to:\r\n* Put the ancestral class on `Object` instead of `Node`\r\n* or have ancestral classes for `Node` _and_ a separate one for `Object`.\r\n\r\nIt kind of depends how many types we eventually want to add to this enum. I don't think it matters _hugely_ on `Node` as it is pretty bloated already, so the difference between using e.g. 4 bits and 32 bits isn't that great.","created_at":"2025-06-13T04:47:29Z","updated_at":"2025-06-13T04:47:30Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107462#discussion_r2144195357","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107462","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2144195357"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107462#discussion_r2144195357"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107462"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2144195357/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":69,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2143345009,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":4,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2149881822","pull_request_review_id":2931924179,"id":2149881822,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6AJJfe","diff_hunk":"@@ -66,6 +66,13 @@ class Node : public Object {\n \t\tPHYSICS_INTERPOLATION_MODE_ON\n \t};\n \n+\tenum AncestralClass : unsigned int {","path":"scene/main/node.h","commit_id":"ae786bd43a47fd54f88eacd2be1a57c478e19cb1","original_commit_id":"abc9057a4e9637bae0afb64c541459a191858924","use